@page "/home"
@page "/{*path}"

@* The library now owns "/", so the site's root document needs a route of its own. "/home" is a
   literal, so it wins over the catch-all below and arrives with a null Path — which is exactly
   what asks the loader for the root index.md/readme.md, whichever the site happens to use. *@
<ContentView Path="@Path" />
